{
	chapter.2AAF5935EA1DE955.title: "Initial research"
	file.0000000000000001.title: "Aeronautics Journal"
	quest.3364BA01A0AF91D8.title: "The Journals of the Founders"
	quest.3364BA01A0AF91D8.quest_desc: [
		"The Journals of the Founders"
		""
		"No one truly knows when — or why — the earth tore free from the world below, rising into the sky to form the floating islands I now call home."
		""
		"The old records are fragmented and few, but they all whisper of the same thing: three Founders. Pioneers who, in the age before the Ascension, kept private journals chronicling their craft, their machines, and their boldest inventions."
		""
		"Each is said to have mastered a single domain:"
		""
		"    📖 The Mechanist — keeper of gears, contraptions, and the secrets of motion."
		"    🌤️ The Skyward — charter of the winds, the clouds, and the art of flight."
		"    🗺️ The Wildlander — explorer of the untamed frontier and the dangers beyond the safe shores."
		""
		"The three covers are not handed out at spawn. They turn up in chests across the islands, same as the torn pages that open later chapters."
		""
		"Objective: Recover the three lost journals of the Founders."
	]
	quest.7E4A1C90B2D83F61.title: "Restore the aerostat"
	quest.7E4A1C90B2D83F61.quest_subtitle: "Envelope intact. No burner."
	quest.7E4A1C90B2D83F61.quest_desc: [
		"A bag hangs at the edge of the island. The envelope still holds a shape. The basket is oak planks. Under it — campfires, not a burner. The shafts do not turn."
		""
		"Take eight envelope blocks from the wreck; they drop as themselves. A campfire will not lift this bag. You need a Hot Air Burner."
		""
		"The basket barrels still hold what they did not finish assembling: iron sheets, andesite alloy, redstone, a block of coal. A crafting table from the planks on the pad. There is no finished burner. Make it, then set it under the envelope in place of the fires."
	]
	quest.8F5B2D01C3E94072.title: "Craft a paraglider"
	quest.8F5B2D01C3E94072.quest_subtitle: "Sticks and aerolite"
	quest.8F5B2D01C3E94072.quest_desc: [
		"You can leave the rock before you have a ship. Four sticks. Three aerolite twigs. Do not look for leather — that recipe is gone."
		""
		"Oak and birch stand on the pad. Aerolite shows in the stone: break it, a twig falls."
	]
	task.3D9CC80F7EADD53D.title: "Finding Lost Diaries"
	task.91A63E12D4FA5183.title: "Salvage 8 envelope blocks"
	task.A2B74F23E50B6294.title: "Craft a Hot Air Burner"
	task.B3C85034F61C73A5.title: "Craft a paraglider"
}
